                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,4"
                                   Text="生成为鸡骑士的幼年尸壳和幼年僵尸猪灵（下界传送门生成的除外）所骑乘的鸡一定是热带鸡，因为其只会在热带生物群系生成。" />
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,4" FontWeight="Bold"
                                   Text="2. 降雪" />
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,4"
                                   Text="雪在云层上也会存在。Notch的解释是云层之上的灰色区域才是雪真正的来源。" />
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,4" FontWeight="Bold"
                                   Text="3. 毒树脂" />
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,4"
                                   Text="“对以上的注释：这些词很好，但我找不到它们的用途[G]。点赞、评论并订阅！我们下次再见，拜拜！”（Comment on ^: These are nice, but I can&apos;t find a use for them [G]. Leave a like, leave a comment, and subscribe!, and see you in the next one, bye!）" />
